        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8561M, Milano Leverset with Wilshire Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Milano Lever with Wilshire Rosette is a wonderful, classically designed lever that will add charm to any traditional home new or old. The great thing about the Milano Leverset with Wilshire Rose is that is will look just as at home in an historical homes as a new build with transitional decor. This leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. Choose from a huge selection of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Milano Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Brass Milano Lever with Wilshire Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
